1	line	Xilo	Hello again, iknami! Thank you for helping us find each other!
1	line	Fabia	To think we were waiting by different trees! It was so silly of us!
1	line	Player	Well, I'm happy to see you together again. Now, I'm sure you have a lot of catching up to do. I'll leave you to it.
